%%% note
read() の multipart は boundary を mime の引数からは取らない (プロパティの boundary だけ)。String を読むときは boundary が要り、Binary なら中身から見つける
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import try from dw::Runtime
output application/json
var body = "--b1\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"x\"\r\n\r\nhello\r\n--b1--\r\n"
---
{
  inMime: try(() -> read(body, "multipart/form-data; boundary=b1")).error.message,
  inProps: read(body, "multipart/form-data", {boundary: "b1"}).parts.x.content,
  binaryFinds: read(body as Binary, "multipart/form-data").parts.x.content
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "inMime": "Exception while reading '--b1\r\nContent-Dispositi...' as 'multipart/form-data; boundary=b1' cause by:\n'boundary' configuration property is missing.\nTrace:\n  at main (Unknown)",
  "inProps": "hello",
  "binaryFinds": "hello"
}
